From 9b6d7abfb978ab1da2c222212010fe74b672f177 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 07:43:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Debugger in the image: libedit listed

Haiku builds and ships Debugger only with the libedit build feature, and
debug_server needs Debugger to write a crash report ("Failed to start
debugger: No such file or directory" when NetSurf crashed on exit and a
report was asked for). libedit is built by prosepkg; listed, the feature
is on, Debugger is in, and the library comes along through dependency
resolution.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Prose-Patch: 0045-debugger-in-the-image-libedit-listed.patch f04b96bbaae72ead6e22c9f5acd9007c9f36922955d42b4dfe3ac7b75e6865f5
---
 build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64 | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

